            "review_title": "Review at Chef Dzung's BBQ & Hotpot buffet",
            "review_text": "PnP Wiz\n41 contributions\n0\nChef Dzung's BBQ & Hotpot buffet\nMar 2018 • Friends\nCame here for dinner on Tuesday night with a group of friends. It is a great place for All You Can Eat. The restaurant has a varieties of seafood, Vietnamese food, and great BBQ. Lots of different kind of meats and seafood for BBQ. Friendly Services and reasonable price compare to other all you can eat nearby. Food are good and constantly refill everything. Love the long nose clams and other kind of snails. Salmon and oyster are fresh, and lots of different baked clams. Eat until you drop....:-) Highly recommended and needed to try out.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 2, 2018",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
